nity events our  social media sites are also a great  resource for our members for things like  holiday hours and special promotions  that we have i'm often asked if you have  to be a teacher to become a member and  the answer is not at all in fact almost  anyone can become a member school  educators administrators and staff are  all eligible for membership but if  you're a school volunteer a student a  retiree or a parent or guardian of a  student involved in an educational  organization in nevada you can also  become a member at silver state schools  credit union you can also join the  credit union by making a one-time  donation to vegas pbs you can apply for  membership by stopping in at any one of  our 10 branch locations where a member  service representative would be more  than happy to assist you or you can  visit us and apply online at  silverstatecu.com  thank you to silver state schools credit  union for sponsoring this segment for  more just call 702-733-8820
 

